                <img src="/pictures/note/ai-tutorial-5-rag-system.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div><h1 id="用-langchain--ollama--pgvector-搭建本地-rag从-0-到-1-的完整实战含-uv-依赖管理--面试指南" class="headerLink">
